# Post-feature QA email + Diagnostics (always)

After any iteration that **adds, changes, or fixes** a user-visible FLOQR feature (or ships a new demo/test surface):

## 1. Email the tester (required)

Send **bans.don@gmail.com** a concise QA brief (SendGrid via `emailFloqrPreviewLinks` / Diagnostics **Email mobile preview links**, or an equivalent preview/QA mailer):

| Section | Content |
|---|---|
| **Status** | Pages `main` SHA + live base URL; Functions deploy status if backend changed |
| **Step-by-step test** | Ordered steps with exact live URLs (`?v=` on app pages; **no `?v=`** on display boards) |
| **What success looks like** | One clear expected result per step |
| **Track results** | Point to Master Admin → Diagnostics → **Manual Feature Tests** — mark **Succeed** / **Failed** + failure note |
| **Troubleshoot** | If Failed: copy **Resolution Prompt**, check listed symptoms, confirm remotes/CI before re-emailing |

Do **not** send the preview/QA email until the post-deploy CI gate is green when Functions/rules changed (`post-deploy-qc.mdc`). If CI cannot be checked, say so in the email and ask the tester to skim Actions for the published SHA.

## 2. Mirror tests in Diagnostics (required)

Same iteration as the code:

1. Add/update entries in `ai-diagnostics-service.js` → `MANUAL_FEATURE_TESTS` with:
   - `id`, `area`, `feature`, `changed`, `howToTest`, `expected`
   - `troubleshoot` — short “if this fails, check…” prompts (include in UI + Codex resolution prompt)
2. Add `PACKAGE_INSTALL_CHECKS` markers for new files / cache-bust strings when a package version ships.
3. Bump `CURRENT_DIAGNOSTICS_PACKAGE_VERSION` / `PREVIEW_LINKS_PACKAGE` and cache-bust `ai-diagnostics-service.js` on `master-admin.html` when diagnostics content changes.
4. Keep the hub page (`feature-tests-*.html`) in sync for deep links when useful.

## 3. Foolproof bar

A feature is not “done” for QA until:

- [ ] Live URLs work on the published environment
- [ ] Manual Feature Test row exists with Succeed/Failed tracking
- [ ] Troubleshooting text exists for the common failure modes
- [ ] Email sent to `bans.don@gmail.com` with steps + track/troubleshoot pointers
- [ ] `docs/FEATURE-WIRING.md` updated (feature-wiring-records rule)

## 4. Do not

- Ship popout-only or chat-only test instructions without Diagnostics + email
- Mark Fixed without asking the tester to re-run the Manual Feature Test and flip Succeed
